it fails, after some point,

252
00:15:19,490 --> 00:15:20,530
to track.

253
00:15:20,530 --> 00:15:23,190
And that's the
generation-verification gap.

254
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:25,470
Does any does anyone
remember that?

255
00:15:28,135 --> 00:15:34,800
OK, so that was-- we saw that
the failure happens after 10

256
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,720
to--

