be more data-efficient.

519
00:30:25,150 --> 00:30:29,010
So the number of labels that
they collected for PRM--

520
00:30:29,010 --> 00:30:36,530
if they match that against
ORM, both PRM and ORM benefit

521
00:30:36,530 --> 00:30:38,730
