solution per problem, based

525
00:30:53,970 --> 00:30:56,430
on the PRM approach and so on.

526
00:31:01,050 --> 00:31:03,770
The other interesting property--

527
00:31:03,770 --> 00:31:07,810
and that's what we
all should strive

528
00:31:07,810 --> 00:31:10,720
