to deal with and optimize

553
00:32:34,710 --> 00:32:38,770
for your system, and that's
an additional complexity here.

554
00:32:38,770 --> 00:32:40,750
But yes.

555
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:45,190
For the previous one, the
