557
00:32:46,410 --> 00:32:50,090
Because PRM requests much
more labels than ORM.

558
00:32:50,090 --> 00:32:54,790
So do they show a plot where
the x-axis is [INAUDIBLE]?

559
00:32:54,790 --> 00:32:57,310
Yeah, I think we were trying to.

560
00:32:57,310 --> 00:32:58,750
Yeah, because they
also mentioned

561
00:32:58,750 --> 00:33:00,450
that it's hard to compare.

562
00:33:00,450 --> 00:33:06,660
And they did manage
to have-- because it's

563
00:33:06,660 --> 00:33:10,800
true ORM needs k
labels for problems,

