583
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:07,130
I assume this should be--

584
00:34:07,130 --> 00:34:08,050
The same?

585
00:34:08,050 --> 00:34:08,929
The same one.

586
00:34:08,929 --> 00:34:10,710
But yeah.

587
00:34:14,330 --> 00:34:16,090
Yes?

588
00:34:16,090 --> 00:34:18,570
How does this avoid when
the reasoning is actually

