00:34:18,570 --> 00:34:20,610
bad, but graded high?

590
00:34:20,610 --> 00:34:25,530
For example, if you
go back to slide 23--

591
00:34:25,530 --> 00:34:26,190
This one?

592
00:34:26,190 --> 00:34:27,175
[INAUDIBLE]

593
00:34:30,570 --> 00:34:31,889
Yeah, this one.

594
00:34:31,889 --> 00:34:36,290
What if the reasoning is,
let's call the numerator x,

